### 0 cli render trip.wtf --format text
$ wtf render trip.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
## Friday, November 20, 2026 · New York | Oaxaca 1 stops · 07:04 AM – 07:04 AM · in 64 days · 24°C / 12°C · light rain · 40% rain

07:04 AM  > Depart JFK

## Saturday, November 21 · Oaxaca 0 stops · in 65 days · no forecast yet; forecasts cover about 16 days

[weather] := forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, F) = 76°F / 53°F · light rain · 40% rain
[rain] := weather.rain = 40%
[celsius] := forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20) = 24°C / 12°C · light rain · 40% rain
[later] := forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-21)
--- stderr
<root>/trip.wtf:10:12: warning: Forecast for Oaxaca on 2026-11-21: no forecast yet; forecasts cover about 16 days

### 1 cli query trip.wtf map(days, fn(d) => {line: d.line, places: d.value.places, forecast: d.value.forecast}) --json
$ wtf query trip.wtf map(days, fn(d) => {line: d.line, places: d.value.places, forecast: d.value.forecast}) --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
